erleaders: Making the Team","released":"2026-11-28T15:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T15:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T16:15:00Z","overview":"As the remaining ladies try out for the media-savvy Show Group, Judy and Kelli are faced with yet another difficult decision, and some dancers rise to glory while others' hearts are broken.","genres":["Series","Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders: Making the Team","released":"2026-11-28T16:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:15:00Z","overview":"Makeovers give the dancers renewed confidence, alum Yuko shares exciting personal news, veteran Lisa makes a hard decision, and Kelli questions Alora-Rose about a rumored distraction.","genres":["Series","Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders: Making the Team","released":"2026-11-28T17:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T17:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T18:15:00Z","overview":"Week nine of training camp intensifies when Kelli and Judy confront Alora-Rose and deliberate squad dismissal decisions one week before the first game of the season.","genres":["Series","Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders: Making the Team","released":"2026-11-28T18:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T18:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:15:00Z","overview":"Kelli and Judy slyly make the final squad announcement, and the new team faces several obstacles before taking the field for their first game as Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders.","genres":["Series","Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders: Making the Team","released":"2026-11-28T19:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T19:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T20:15:00Z","overview":"Over 600 excited and anxious Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders hopefuls arrive at Texas Stadium for the preliminary auditions.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders: Making the Team","released":"2026-11-28T20:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T20:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T20:45:00Z","overview":"In the finals audition, the competition really heats up. Now, surviving candidates must go head-to-head against experienced veteran cheerleaders for a coveted spot in the DCC Training Camp.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders: Making the Team","released":"2026-11-28T20:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T20:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T21:15:00Z","overview":"Training Camp begins! The newly elected training camp candidates are excited, even star-struck, as they meet the veterans for the first time at Valley Ranch.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders: Making the Team","released":"2026-11-28T21:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T21:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T21:45:00Z","overview":"The group competes in a grueling army fitness test to try and earn the privilege of being on the elite \"Power Squad.\" At that evening's rehearsal, the first cuts will be made.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders: Making the Team","released":"2026-11-28T21:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T21:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T22:15:00Z","overview":"The rookies are given \"makeovers\" to transform them into the image of a DCC.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders: Making the Team","released":"2026-11-28T22:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T22:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T22:45:00Z","overview":"The entire squad needs a wake-up call and guest choreographer Kitty Carter gives it to them.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders: Making the Team","released":"2026-11-28T22:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T22:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T23:15:00Z","overview":"The final dance rehearsal of week 7 has a surprise guest judge who puts everyone on edge. Ultimately, in Kelli's office, the tears flow as some dreams surprisingly come to an end.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders: Making the Team","released":"2026-11-28T23:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T23:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T00:15:00Z","overview":"Join 65,000 screaming Cowboys fans as the cheerleaders hit the turf and wow the entire stadium and themselves during their first Dallas Cowboys football game of the season.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders: Making the Team","released":"2026-11-29T00:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T00:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T01:15:00Z","overview":"This is the inside story of selecting this year's Dallas Cowboys Cheerleaders squad with all the emotion and drama as hundreds of women hope to fill the 45-member team.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"DCC: Making the Team – Live","released":"2026-11-29T01:15:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T01:15:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"DCC: Making the Team – Live","released":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"DCC: Making the Team – Live","released":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T09:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"DCC: Making the Team – Live","released":"2026-11-29T09:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T09:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T12:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_DCCMakingtheTeam_us","title":"DCC: Making the Team – Live","released":"2026-11-29T12:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T12:00:00Z",